I have added a navigation system to switch between the "Home" and "About" pages. The "About" page features a personal section about your journey as a coffee lover and a heartfelt tribute to the morning cup.

```html:index.html
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>The Coffee Haven | Explore the Brew</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <nav class="main-nav">
      <button id="nav-home" class="nav-link active">Home</button>
      <button id="nav-about" class="nav-link">About Me</button>
      <button id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Toggle dark mode">
        <span class="toggle-icon">🌙</span>
      </button>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="card">
    <!-- Home View -->
    <div id="home-view">
      <p class="eyebrow">BREWED WITH PASSION</p>
      <h1>The Art of the Perfect Brew</h1>
      <p>From the high-altitude plantations to your morning cup, coffee is more than just a drink—it's a ritual. Discover the nuances of different beans and the science of the perfect pour.</p>

      <div class="coffee-content">
        <section>
          <h2>From Bean to Cup</h2>
          <p>Explore the journey of the Arabica and Robusta beans, harvested from diverse climates around the world to create unique flavor profiles ranging from citrusy and bright to chocolatey and bold.</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <h2>Brewing Methods</h2>
          <p>Whether you prefer the precision of a Pour-Over, the richness of a French Press, or the intense kick of an Espresso, mastering your method is the key to unlocking hidden notes.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <button id="hello" type="button">Get Inspired</button>
      <p id="message" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>

    <!-- About View -->
    <div id="about-view" class="hidden">
      <p class="eyebrow">MY STORY</p>
      <h1>About Me & My Brew</h1>
      <p>Hello! I'm a seeker of the perfect roast. My journey into the world of specialty coffee began with a simple curiosity about where my morning caffeine actually came from. That curiosity turned into a passion for understanding the chemistry of extraction, the geography of terroir, and the craftsmanship of the roast.</p>

      <div class="coffee-content">
        <section>
          <h2>Why I Appreciate Coffee</h2>
          <p>To me, coffee is the ultimate pause button. In a world that moves at lightning speed, the 10 minutes it takes to grind beans, boil water, and pour the first cup is a moment of intentionality. I appreciate it for:</p>
          <ul class="appreciation-list">
            <li><strong>The Ritual:</strong> The warmth of the mug in my hands and the familiar aroma of fresh grounds.</li>
            <li><strong>The Variety:</strong> How a single bean can tell a story of a specific mountain range or a rainy season.</li>
            <li><strong>The Connection:</strong> Sharing a pot with a friend is one of the oldest ways humans build community.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>
      </div>
      <button id="hello-about" type="button">A Toast to Coffee</button>
      <p id="message-about" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

